  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb with a spelling change: **c → qu before e**, to preserve the hard \"k\" sound",
    "Only affects the yo form of the pretérito indefinido (ataqué, not \"atacé\") and the entire subjuntivo presente (ataque, ataques...)",
    "No stem changes; regular past participle: **atacado**",
    "Related noun: **el ataque** (the attack)",
    "Common usage: *atacar por sorpresa* (to attack by surprise), *un ataque de risa* (a fit of laughter)"
  ],
